{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources to build and upgrade your base. Automate defenses and resource production to create a self-sufficient stronghold in a post-apocalyptic world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236240/extras/4bdef7da17bc007ef9d398a61222a674.poster.avif?t=1749838581\" width=600 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236240/extras/4bdef7da17bc007ef9d398a61222a674.webm?t=1749838581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236240/extras/4bdef7da17bc007ef9d398a61222a674.mp4?t=1749838581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Base</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your campsite into a fortified base built for survival. Upgrade structures, set traps, place turrets, and optimize your layout to hold off giant zombie hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236240/extras/ae2ff86b00d440bc86d749d3940202fe.poster.avif?t=1749838581\" width=600 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236240/extras/ae2ff86b00d440bc86d749d3940202fe.webm?t=1749838581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236240/extras/ae2ff86b00d440bc86d749d3940202fe.mp4?t=1749838581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive in a Dangerous World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot and explore an open world filled with valuable weapons, food, and supplies. Face the ever-present threat of zombie hordes and watch out for other scavengers who may be lurking in the shadows. Find survivors across the world scattered throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236240/extras/a8f25945d4de61559ae78943ce9b1ba3.poster.avif?t=1749838581\" width=600 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236240/extras/a8f25945d4de61559ae78943ce9b1ba3.webm?t=1749838581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236240/extras/a8f25945d4de61559ae78943ce9b1ba3.mp4?t=1749838581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from hundreds of customization options to create your ideal character.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Happy Camper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2236240/80a6f14ee0a18faab5efdd07e8c5ec07067ee7b2.jpg"},{"name":"Zombie Magnet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2236240/f9e37832fb360e7b322d0ecfa075c32be104443f.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor of the Apocalypse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2236240/265b224dbc19964f26fea31e6469b3b861d9b092.jpg"},{"name":"Scavenger Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2236240/a80a44902058e5891accb05980ea2fb3ba4f90a7.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2236240?t=1749838581","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/a